        <mxCell id="9O7hutnVVW2RKfLPjpit-5" value="The island" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="200" y="150" width="120" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="9O7hutnVVW2RKfLPjpit-7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; line-height: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 5px; line-height: 5px;&quot;&gt;Same race as the people of the lands to the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 5px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;north but culturally diff as they now see then self&#39;s as Isleman not Northman&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; line-height: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 5px; background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;They have been cut of from the main content for over 200 years thanks to the boiling seas&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; line-height: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 5px;&quot;&gt;place names and language have been corrupted over time reflecting the diverging culture&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; line-height: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 5px;&quot;&gt;The land is split into 4 areas the western Somershore County (originally known as The county of Somershire)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; line-height: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 5px;&quot;&gt;The Shattered lands running through the centre of the Island. These were caused by the same event the made the boiling seas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; line-height: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 5px;&quot;&gt;The Duchy of The Isle (originally known as the Duchy of Suisle) in the East .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; line-height: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 5px;&quot;&gt;In the past the duchy covered the hole island but after the shattered lands was formed travel&amp;nbsp; across the island dwindled&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; line-height: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 5px;&quot;&gt;Finally there is The Fingers a stretch of coastland consisting of long thin spurs of land and bays. These are technically in the Duchy of the Isle&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="42.5" y="230" width="435" height="120" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="wec9Ze63oyw1QcqTsG4U-5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="wec9Ze63oyw1QcqTsG4U-1" target="wec9Ze63oyw1QcqTsG4U-2">
